#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:532
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_SaveAndShutDown"
msgid ""
"Would you like to save the game and\n"
"shut down now?$"
msgstr ""
"要记录游戏进度\n"
"并关机吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_RetireFromChallenge"
msgid ""
"Would you like to retire from your\n"
"Set KO Tourney challenge?$"
msgstr "要放弃淘汰赛的挑战吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:540
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_SavingPleaseWait"
msgid ""
"I am saving your game data.\n"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"正在记录游戏数据。\n"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:544
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_RecordLastBattle"
msgid ""
"Would you like to record your last\n"
"battle on your FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""
"要把你上一场对战\n"
"录到开拓通行证里吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:548
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_NowFaceTycoon"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"Your skill level is truly astounding!\p"
"We now would like you to face our\n"
"leader, the ARENA TYCOON!$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你的实力真是令人惊叹！\p"
"接下来，请你挑战我们的首领——\n"
"竞技场大亨！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:554
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_PreparedForTycoon"
msgid ""
"A battle with the ARENA TYCOON!\n"
"Are you prepared?$"
msgstr ""
"和竞技场大亨的对战！\n"
"你准备好了吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:558
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_MakeWayForGreta"
msgid ""
"REFEREE: The ARENA TYCOON!\n"
"Make way for GRETA!$"
msgstr ""
"裁判：竞技场大亨！\n"
"葛蕾塔登场！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:562
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GretaYoureChallenger"
msgid ""
"GRETA: Hey!\n"
"Howdy!\p"
"…Wait, are you the challenger?$"
msgstr ""
"葛蕾塔：嘿！\n"
"你好！\p"
"……等等，你就是挑战者？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:567
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_IsThatRight"
msgid ""
"Is that right? Hmm…\n"
"Hmhm…$"
msgstr ""
"是吗？嗯……\n"
"嗯嗯……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_YouLookWeakTakeThingsEasy"
msgid ""
"I don't know how to say it, but…\n"
"To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak.\l"
"Are you sure you're up for me?\p"
"Hmm…\p"
"Well, all right!\n"
"We'll take things easy to start with!$"
msgstr ""
"我不知道该怎么说，不过……\n"
"说白了，你看起来挺弱的。\l"
"你确定你是我的对手吗？\p"
"嗯……\p"
"好吧，算了！\n"
"一开始我们就轻松点吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:579
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_IgniteMyPassionForBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay! Let's see you ignite my passion\n"
"for battle!$"
msgstr ""
"好！让我看看你能不能\n"
"点燃我对战的热情吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:583
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GretaYoureToughAfterAll"
msgid ""
"GRETA: Ow, wait a second!\n"
"You are tough after all!\p"
"I like you!\n"
"Let's see your FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""
"葛蕾塔：哎哟，等一下！\n"
"你果然很厉害嘛！\p"
"我喜欢你！\n"
"给我看看你的开拓通行证吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:589
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedGutsSymbol"
msgid ""
"The Guts Symbol was embossed on\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"开拓通行证上\n"
"印上了毅力标志！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:593
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GoingToBeFunNextTime"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\p"
"It's going to be fun the next time!\n"
"I'm looking forward to it!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\p"
"下次一定会很好玩！\n"
"我很期待哦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:598
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GretaLookingForwardToSeeingAgain"
msgid ""
"GRETA: Hey! Howdy!\n"
"You finally won your way up to me!\p"
"I was getting worried waiting for you!\n"
"I was really looking forward to seeing\l"
"you again!$"
msgstr ""
"葛蕾塔：嘿！你好！\n"
"你终于打到我这里来了！\p"
"等你等得我都担心了！\n"
"我真的很期待\l"
"再见到你呢！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:605
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_SoAreYouReady"
msgid ""
"… … …\n"
"So, are you ready?$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… ……\n"
"那么，你准备好了吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:609
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_WontAllowHalfheartedEffort"
msgid ""
"I won't allow a halfhearted effort!\n"
"Be ready for a thrashing!$"
msgstr ""
"我可不允许你敷衍了事！\n"
"做好被痛扁的准备吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:613
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_LetsGetThisStarted"
msgid ""
"Come on, REFEREE!\n"
"Let's get this started!$"
msgstr ""
"来吧，裁判！\n"
"我们开始吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:617
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GretaBlownAway"
msgid ""
"GRETA: Gaaah! Blown away!\n"
"Let's see your FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"葛蕾塔：啊啊！被打飞了！\n"
"给我看看你的开拓通行证！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:621
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_GutsSymbolTookGoldenShine"
msgid ""
"The Guts Symbol took on\n"
"a golden shine!$"
msgstr ""
"毅力标志\n"
"发出了金色的光芒！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom/scripts.inc:625
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaBattleRoom_Text_IfWeBattleAgainWontLose"
msgid ""
"Arrrgh!\n"
"This is so infuriating!\p"
"If we ever battle again, I won't lose!\n"
"Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊啊啊！\n"
"真是气死我了！\p"
"要是我们再对战，我绝对不会输！\n"
"你可别忘了！拜拜！$"
